{
  "declaredLength": 5380,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi cherches-tu à devenir plus FORTE ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200710075006F0069002000630068006500720063006800650073002D00740075002000E000200064006500760065006E0069007200200070006C0075007300200046004F0052005400450020003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour moi-même.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F007500720020006D006F0069002D006D00EA006D0065002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "N’est-ce pas égoïste ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLa force est pour moi un moyen de protéger Albia.\nDe protéger la ville tout entière !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai toujours pas réussi à digérer ma défaite\ncontre Violine...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200074006F0075006A006F00750072007300200070006100730020007200E90075007300730069002000E0002000640069006700E90072006500720020006D00610020006400E900660061006900740065000A0063006F006E007400720065002000560069006F006C0069006E0065002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais cette amertume me rend plus forte.\nJ’suis déterminée à aller de l’avant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si j’dépasse Violine, j’aurai plus peur de personne.\nC’est pour ça que j’continue à me battre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Au final, tu ne te bats que pour toi-même...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075002000660069006E0061006C002C0020007400750020006E006500200074006500200062006100740073002000710075006500200070006F0075007200200074006F0069002D006D00EA006D0065002E002E002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Dresseurs ne devraient PAS se battre pour\nleur propre intérêt !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007300200044007200650073007300650075007200730020006E006500200064006500760072006100690065006E00740020005000410053002000730065002000620061007400740072006500200070006F00750072000A006C006500750072002000700072006F00700072006500200069006E007400E9007200EA00740020002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Psst... Par ici.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007300730074002E002E002E00200050006100720020006900630069002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu tombes bien. Tu vas m’aider à mettre fin\nà leur débat.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200074006F006D0062006500730020006200690065006E002E00200054007500200076006100730020006D201900610069006400650072002000E00020006D00650074007400720065002000660069006E000A00E00020006C0065007500720020006400E9006200610074002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> est là. Battons-nous pour\ndéterminer qui de vous deux a raison.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000200065007300740020006C00E0002E00200042006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F0075007300200070006F00750072000A006400E9007400650072006D0069006E00650072002000710075006900200064006500200076006F00750073002000640065007500780020006100200072006100690073006F006E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, battons-nous !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002C00200062006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne comptez pas sur moi...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006500200063006F006D007000740065007A002000700061007300200073007500720020006D006F0069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pas en parlant qu’on devient plus fort !\nC’est en s’battant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019006500730074002000700061007300200065006E0020007000610072006C0061006E00740020007100752019006F006E002000640065007600690065006E007400200070006C0075007300200066006F0072007400200021000A0043201900650073007400200065006E00200073201900620061007400740061006E00740020002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! Bats-toi contre les Poings de\nla Justice avec moi !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAide-moi à leur montrer ce en quoi j’crois !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je réclame un duel !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007200E90063006C0061006D006500200075006E0020006400750065006C0020002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’veux rentrer chez moi.\nCommençons le combat.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190076006500750078002000720065006E00740072006500720020006300680065007A0020006D006F0069002E000A0043006F006D006D0065006E00E7006F006E00730020006C006500200063006F006D006200610074002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battons-nous !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un instant !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Certaines leçons ne peuvent être apprises\nqu’en surmontant les plus grands obstacles !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La FORCE pure est l’alliée de la JUSTICE !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200046004F0052004300450020007000750072006500200065007300740020006C20190061006C006C006900E900650020006400650020006C00610020004A0055005300540049004300450020002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je te croyais moins indécis<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000740065002000630072006F00790061006900730020006D006F0069006E007300200069006E006400E900630069007300100003110000FF01000065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La force pure est l’alliée de la justice !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200066006F0072006300650020007000750072006500200065007300740020006C20190061006C006C006900E900650020006400650020006C00610020006A0075007300740069006300650020002100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! Bats-toi contre les Poings de\nla Justice avec moi !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAide-moi à leur montrer ce en quoi j’crois !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hexadron, méga-évolue !\nLa JUSTICE triomphera !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650078006100640072006F006E002C0020006D00E900670061002D00E90076006F006C0075006500200021000A004C00610020004A0055005300540049004300450020007400720069006F006D007000680065007200610020002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lugulabre...\nMéga-évolue, et finissons-en !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C007500670075006C0061006200720065002E002E002E000A004D00E900670061002D00E90076006F006C00750065002C002000650074002000660069006E006900730073006F006E0073002D0065006E0020002100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai gardé l’meilleur pour la fin !\nKravarech, méga-évolue et déchaîne-toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se battre pour soi-même ?\nOu bien se battre pour autrui ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530065002000620061007400740072006500200070006F0075007200200073006F0069002D006D00EA006D00650020003F000A004F00750020006200690065006E002000730065002000620061007400740072006500200070006F0075007200200061007500740072007500690020003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces deux philosophies se valent.\nFinalement, rien ne sert de les opposer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’suis d’accord ! Ton altruisme te permet\nd’atteindre un état d’esprit en béton !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ton compliment me va droit au cœur !\nPour te remercier, accepte cette tenue !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Désolée, mais j’ai juré de garder la tenue que\nj’porte jusqu’à ce que j’me libère de Violine...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je comprends. Alors, c’est à toi que je la donne,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200063006F006D007000720065006E00640073002E00200041006C006F00720073002C002000632019006500730074002000E000200074006F006900200071007500650020006A00650020006C006100200064006F006E006E0065002C000A0010000201000000002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez un kimono de Nivis d’une autre\ncouleur !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A00200075006E0020006B0069006D006F006E006F0020006400650020004E00690076006900730020006420190075006E0065002000610075007400720065000A0063006F0075006C006500750072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et si ça t’intéresse, il paraît que quelqu’un peut\nte faire la même coupe de cheveux que mon frère.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nIl ne faut pas avoir peur du ridicule...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La quête de la force pure est un chemin sans fin.\nBattons-nous encore si nous en avons l’occasion !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Delphie serait plus à sa place au dojo que moi...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065006C0070006800690065002000730065007200610069007400200070006C00750073002000E000200073006100200070006C00610063006500200061007500200064006F006A006F00200071007500650020006D006F0069002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai l’impression d’avoir affronté Nivis dans\nun tournoi d’arts martiaux quand j’étais gamine...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    }
  ],
